        "agencyContactEmail": "Ann.Stahl@usda.gov",
        "agencyContactEmailDesc": "Program Manager",
        "synopsisDesc": "<p>The Rural Business-Cooperative Service announces the availability of $6,000,000 in competitive grant funds for the FY 2026 Delta Health Care Services Grant (DHCS) Program as authorized under Section 379G of the Consolidated Farm and Rural Development Act (7 U.S.C. 2008u), as amended by the Agricultural Act of 2018 (Pub. L. 115-334).&nbsp;The purpose of this program is to provide financial assistance to address the continued unmet health needs in the Delta Region, through cooperation among health care professionals, institutions of higher education, research institutions and economic development entities in the Delta Region.</p>",
        "responseDate": "Jun 01, 2026 12:00:00 AM EDT",
